foreground hover:text-secondary focus:outline-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow pt-20\"><div class=\"py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><span class=\"inline-block py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-secondary border border-secondary/20 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-4\">About The Firm</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-primary\">A Legacy of Legal Excellence</h1></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:text-primary text-muted-foreground\"><p class=\"lead text-xl text-foreground font-medium mb-8\">AKM Associates &amp; Legal Consultants is a premier legal advisory firm dedicated to delivering exceptional legal strategies and representation to clients worldwide.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4\">Our Core Philosophy</h2><p class=\"mb-6\">We believe that every legal challenge presents an opportunity for strategic growth and protection. Our approach is grounded in three core principles: clarity in counsel, authority in representation, and transparency in all dealings.</p><p class=\"mb-6\">With over two decades of consolidated experience, our team of legal experts brings unparalleled insight into corporate structures, family matters, real estate, and dispute resolution.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4\">Why Choose Us?</h2><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-secondary mr-2 font-bold\">•</span><span><strong>Tailored Strategies:</strong> We do not believe in one-size-fits-all solutions. Every case is meticulously analyzed to craft a bespoke legal strategy.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-secondary mr-2 font-bold\">•</span><span><strong>Global Standards:</strong> While deeply rooted in local jurisprudence, our operational standards match top-tier international law firms.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-secondary mr-2 font-bold\">•</span><span><strong>Client-Centric:</strong> Your goals are our priority. We maintain open communication and provide transparent, actionable advice.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground pt-16 pb-8\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-12\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"relative h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-white/10 p-1\"><img alt=\"Araththaai Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"48px\" srcSet=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_32/f_auto/q_auto/v1/araththaai_k0wo2e?_a=BAVMn6E80 32w, https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_48/f_auto/q_auto/v1/araththaai_k0wo2e?_a=BAVMn6E80 48w, https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_64/f_auto/q_auto/v1/araththaai_k0wo2e?_a=BAVMn6E80 64w, https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_96/f_auto/q_auto/v1/araththaai_k0wo2e?_a=BAVMn6E80 96w, https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_128/f_auto/q_auto/v1/araththaai_k0wo2e?_a=BAVMn6E80 128w, https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_256/f_auto/q_auto/v1/araththaai_k0wo2e?_a=BAVMn6E80 256w, https://res.cloudinary.com/r0lvbyu3/image/upload/c_limit,w_384/f_auto/q_auto/v1/arath